<%# The Transitland terms ask for their name and a link to the terms wherever their data %>
<%# is shown, so it sits on every page that carries departures or stops. Worded and %>
<%# styled to match the weather credit, so the dashboard acknowledges its sources the %>
<%# same way everywhere. %>
<%# The gap is part of the credit, not the page above it: sitting flush against the last %>
<%# link made it easy to hit by accident on a touchscreen. %>
<br /><br />
<div class='credit'><a href="https://www.transit.land/terms" target="_blank"><%= t('departures.attribution') %></a></div>
